*) evpn - fix VNI staying stopped after an EVPN instance parameter change;
*) hotspot - fix flash prefix being added to html-directory on devices without flash storage;
*) ipsec - fix IKEv2 peers disconnecting when viewing installed SAs in WinBox;
*) ipsec - fix policies remaining in the invalid state after adding another policy (introduced in v7.25);
